    "kind": "behavior",
    "description": "S1/S2 keep exact native question identities and full payloads across bounded pages; accepted answers stay queued/running until delivery and stale requests remain rejected. Existing native-device and installed-host gaps remain open.",
    "implementation": "questionPage and Store.QuestionPage retain exact JSON and stable ordering; the operation worker invokes the existing factory Answer checks after durable safe metadata, while wrapper question pagination preserves the selected question identity, clamps drained final pages, and retains question-keyed text/JSON drafts through pending reads and navigation.",
    "tests": "TestQuestionPagesKeepExactLargePayloads checks 55 requests, the second page total and large Unicode content after chunk reconstruction. The browser question-page assertion sends q54 and its exact nested answer rather than a page-relative ID. New final-page drain and text/JSON draft assertions prove all remaining questions are reachable and pending/navigation cannot erase unsent answers."
  },
